The JWT_SECRET is not generated by an external service, nor do you need to download it. It is a private passphrase of your choice used by your server code to securely sign and verify authentication tokens (JSON Web Tokens).

Method 1: Create a Random Secret Phrase (Recommended)
You can choose any long, unique combination of characters.
If you want a cryptographically secure string, run this single command in your terminal to generate one automatically:
"openssl rand -hex 32"

