Local .env File (Inside Backend/.env)

    Change MONGODB_URL=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/ecommerce to your MongoDB Atlas connection string (e.g., mongodb+srv://admin:Password@cluster0.xxx.mongodb.net/ecommerce).

