Terraform Secret File (terraform.tfvars)

    Put your MongoDB Atlas string here too:
    Terraform

    mongodb_url = "mongodb+srv://admin:YourPassword@cluster0.xxx.mongodb.net/ecommerce"
    jwt_secret  = "6d0368553c88105c12580fec0eaef55ce4b19a19755dc9dfe4d70efd9c52ccab"
    github_repo_url = "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_REPO.git"

    This is the file you encrypt using git secret add terraform.tfvars and git secret hide. Terraform uses these values to build your production server on AWS EC2 automatically!

